    <textbox x="120" y="362.04" width="690" height="822.48" font="Arial" size="18.0" min_font_size="18.0" color="#333333" align="left" vertical_align="top" single_line="false" max_lines="21" overflow="clip" line_spacing="1.08" safety_ratio="1.0" margin_left="0" margin_right="0" margin_top="0" margin_bottom="0">• 1. Công thức năng lượng Einstein:
<math-field>E = mc^2</math-field>
• 2. Phương trình bậc hai: <math-field>x =
\frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 -
4ac}}{2a}</math-field>
• 3. Định lý Pythagore: <math-field>a^2 +
b^2 = c^2</math-field>
• 4. Tích phân: <math-field>\int_0^1
x^2\,dx = \frac{1}{3}</math-field>
• 5. Tổng dãy số:
<math-field>\sum_{i=1}^{n} i =
\frac{n(n+1)}{2}</math-field>
• 6. Giới hạn: <math-field>\lim_{x\to 0}
\frac{\sin x}{x} = 1</math-field>
• 7. Ma trận: <math-field>A =
\begin{bmatrix}1 &amp; 2 \\ 3 &amp;
4\end{bmatrix}</math-field>
• 8. Xác suất: <math-field>P(A\mid B) =
\frac{P(A \cap B)}{P(B)}</math-field>
• 9. Ký hiệu Hy Lạp: <math-field>\alpha +
\beta = \gamma</math-field></textbox>
